l" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1546989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="ashausesall" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1546989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall" >ashausesall</a></span></li> <li><em>你们几个，不要玩了，滚回去工作！</em></li> </ul> <p>6. <strong>广告</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:xiang-cheng-kai-fa-piao">香城开发票，兼代办证、代购产品、代写论文</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></li> <li><em>先验证、后付款,欢迎您咨询!</em></li> </ul> <p>7. <strong>审核</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/doom">末日</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/archibald1" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2265704&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Archibald1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2265704)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/archibald1" >Archibald1</a></span></li> <li><em>Ding成功拯救了基金会&#8230;&#8230;虽然是以最丢人的方式达成的。</em></li> </ul> <p>8. <strong>神話</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:lexicon-noricst">诺莱斯志异</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/enflowerz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4457426&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Enflowerz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4457426)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/enflowerz" >Enflowerz</a></span></li> <li><em>这里记述着一个已化为灰烬的文明的一切。</em></li> </ul> <p>9. <strong>建国</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/foundation-of-the-empire">立國之本</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745583&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="MScarlet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745583)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" >MScarlet</a></span></li> <li><em>国家的建立一般都伴随着一个个可歌可泣的故事；但这个国家的建立，卻是从一件玩具开始的。</em></li> </ul> <p>10. <strong>逆模因</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/antimeme-guide">简单易懂的逆模因识别指南（节选）</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="TimeElapsed" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" >TimeElapsed</a></span></li> <li><em>相信我，你不会想，也不会知道作者的下场是怎样的。</em></li> </ul> <p>11. <strong>超形上学</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/veleafer-s-proposal">SCP-CN-001：Veleafer的提案-演绎部</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veleafer" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2934041&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Veleafer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2934041)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veleafer" >Veleafer</a></span></li> <li><em>将会有一场RK级叙事崩毁，我们的作者，某个更上叙事的人把我们的叙事线打了一个结，想看好戏。</em></li> </ul> <p>12. <strong>圣诞节</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/merry-freakmas">圣诞快乐</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forgotmydrug" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4313927&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="ForgotMyDrug" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4313927)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forgotmydrug" >ForgotMyDrug</a></span></li> <li><em>在圣诞节的夜里，小乔治渡过了一個难忘的晚上。</em></li> </ul> <p>13. <strong>新年</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/new-year-bell">新年钟声 暨 Dr.Marleak是怎样收容跨年晚会的</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4354147&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Simon Arran" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4354147)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran" >Simon Arran</a></span></li> <li><em>随着Duang的一声，基金会又平安踏进新的一年，Ramen。</em></li> </ul> <p>14. <strong>科幻</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/kill-the-world">K-96时停对策雷</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bitchangelover" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2995593&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="bitchangelover" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2995593)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bitchangelover" >bitchangelover</a></span></li> <li><em>要对付世上最难缠的时停能力持有者，你需要简单管用的理论、将理论化为现实的手段、以及必要的牺牲。</em></li> </ul> <p>15. <strong>因果</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1485">SCP-CN-1485</a></strong> - 将尔晦明，彼凭一叩 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span></li> <li><em>记住，别像我们一样带入外来物。</em></li> </ul> <p>16. <strong>Bright博士</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/jack-bright-resting-at-last">Jack Bright在此安息</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span></li> <li><em>每说一声再见，就是死去一点。——《漫长的告别》</em></li> </ul> <p>17. <strong>北欧神话</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1143">SCP-CN-1143</a></strong> - 北欧的终结 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></li> <li><em>“只要那孩子还立在大地上，他就是不败的”</em></li> </ul> <p>18. <strong>赛博朋克</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/neur0mancer">亚伯拉罕末班车</a></strong> by (account deleted)</li> <li>“<em>你真他妈是一疯狗，畜生。”第十三个妓女尸体躺在地上，话还未说完就跟着腹部流出来肠子昏歇。</em>”</li> </ul> <p>19. <strong>演化</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1868">SCP-CN-1868</a></strong> - 自知之明 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5288378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Dr Zhengshi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5288378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" >Dr Zhengshi</a></span></li> <li><em>演化之路永无止境，我们同样不曾奢望自己已经无需超越自己，便能行至尽头。</em></li> </ul> <p>20. <strong>武术</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sharkypedia-eoyemlau">游音流 - 鲨击百科</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></li> <li><em>只要在我的音击里，妳的命运最终都会落到我这拳头上。 ——游音流大师丝嘉丽，于1941年殴打古鲨．古拉时</em></li> </ul> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745583&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607606880" alt="MScarlet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745583)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mscarlet" >MScarlet</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
